# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data
#
# Nothing here is hand-authored -- every file is either downloaded or produced
# by a script, so it is regenerated rather than versioned.
#
#   data/raw/          RentCast API responses. Their licensing covers derivative
#                      works and distribution to end users of your application;
#                      it does not clearly permit republishing their records as
#                      a public dataset. Keep local. Regenerate:
#                        python3 scripts/rentcast_pull.py --pull --circle <name>
#   data/geo/source/   66 MB of Census archives. Regenerate: build_geo.py
#   data/geo/*.geojson Clipped from the above. Regenerate: build_geo.py
#   data/processed/    Derived. Regenerate: clean.py then features.py
#
# Kept: data/external/ (112 KB of public-domain Census + Zillow research
# summaries) and the filter log, so the pipeline's decisions stay reviewable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/
data/geo/source/
data/geo/*.geojson
data/quota_log.jsonl

data/processed/*
!data/processed/clean_filter_log.csv

# Notebook backups / scratch copies
*.BACKUP.ipynb
*-checkpoint.ipynb

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node / web app
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
web/dist/
*.local

